{title: Tell Me the Stories of Jesus}
{artist: William Parker & Frederic Challinor}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
[F]Tell me the stories of [Bb]Jesus I [F]love to hear —
[Gm]things I would [C]ask him to [F]tell me if [C]he were here:
[F]scenes by the [C]wayside, [Dm]tales of the [Bb]sea,
[F]stories of [C]Jesus, tell [Bb]them [C]to [F]me.
